{
  "_comment": "Researcher requests and the tool calls an assistant makes for them (one list per assistant turn). Responses live in responses.json, drafted after reading the observed results and tied to their digest via response_for. Splits are assigned per lineage group. Capture: python -m cancer_workbench curriculum capture.",
